<title>POLAND: NBP rejects all bids at its 300 mln revrepo.</title>
<headline>NBP rejects all bids at its 300 mln revrepo.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all of the 10 million zloty bids at its 300 million zloty reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
